  "limits": "Ends are closed but not ground flat, so the spring does not stand on a flat face. The height changes pitch abruptly where active coils meet end coils. The rate uses the basic formula G d^4 / (8 D^3 n) without the Wahl curvature correction and assumes small deflections. Extension spring hooks are not modelled. Verified in Blender 5.2.1; written for the 4.2 API.",
